-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Axes: Table: Axes. A distinct dimension, angle, or vector along which AI's impact on education can be examined -- e.g. 'Essay Writing vs. AI-Assisted Exploration'. New axes can be added freely as the project's scope grows.
